          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "\n5. Being aggrieved by the registration of FIR, the applicant has preferred this application to quash and set aside the FIR since the allegations made do not constitute the commission of any of the offences."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5358ef08be8e4aaaae0e718f5ed28013_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "We have appreciated the rival contentions of the parties, perused the FIR and record, and gone through the relevant provisions, i.e. Sections 26, 27, 29, and 30 of the Act."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5bc2d3b859974f1d967797f270228779_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "10. At the outset, the prosecution case is that accused Nos. 1 and 2 purchased the seized contraband articles from the applicant in Telangana State."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f1aecd74b02f4a76b7ead0d5bd6f5140_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "While transporting them in Maharashtra State, on Pusad-Washim road, near Aadgaon Fata, the police tried to intercept the vehicle, causing an accident."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bf57a1d37c6545e3b939766290262186_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The only allegations against the applicant are that the contraband articles were purchased from him in Telangana State."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "aaa9a93a83e247b6a501314d93c785f3_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Hence, the police have registered an FIR against the applicant."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ad2e2587638547edb9fed4318e091193_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. It is not the case of the prosecution that they have seized the contraband articles from the possession of the applicant or that any of the witnesses have stated that the applicant knew that the said contraband articles were purchased b"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9a28046b2a0c4eadb435d4723f26c9f4_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nNo material has been brought on record to prima facie connect the applicant with the seizure of the said articles or the present crime."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d88cda5d057a4bca8b2444658bcc35da_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Undisputedly, the contraband articles were seized in Maharashtra and accused Nos. 1 and 2 were 6 APL1371.2024..odt also arrested in Maharashtra."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7769c5314dba4c06b609fd13da1048b9_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Except for the said allegations, no material has been produced on record to show that the applicant has any concern with the said articles or that the applicant, with intent to sell the same in Maharashtra State, sold the same to accused No"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "63e322e2cfbb4ddf90d46c3cf2cb2f22_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As per the prosecution case, the contraband articles were seized within the territory of Maharashtra State."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "93e4dbc490ac4622ab2044a2f7cd8907_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It has not been brought to our notice that during the investigation, the Investigating Officer seized any contraband article from the applicant's possession to connect him to the present crime."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "84cf87ceeda44bb79c89457f341f921c_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Similarly, the prosecution has failed to point out from the statement of the witnesses that the applicant has sold the contraband to accused Nos. 1 and 2 to sell it within Maharashtra, even assuming that there is prohibition in the State of"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "748d7d0bd1d543e9beed97c3e8432f73_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The prosecution failed to show that the applicant is also responsible for 7 APL1371.2024..odt violation of the provisions of the Act within the State of Samiullah Khan Azmathullah Khan vs The State Of Maharashtra Thr. P.S.O., ... on 17 Dece"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9a7ae08af1c14ac3a68247f5f08d8232_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Except for the allegation that accused Nos. 1 and 2 purchased the contraband articles from the applicant, nothing has been brought on record to connect him to the present crime."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "12fc25144380487c8f19ca95435b8b21_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Based on the futile allegations, continuation of prosecution against the applicant would not be proper."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "88d86ded13cc42788453d828e39af9fc_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "13. The Hon'ble Apex Court, in various decisions, has held that \"the ultimate object of justice is to find out the truth, punish the guilty, and protect the innocent."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f963a765ac6a41d6b1677a2b3bbd6a28_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "To find out the truth is a herculean task."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "dbfb2e4faf434d49948a8bccb9755bac_45",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The courts have to be extremely careful and cautious in dealing with the complaint and must consider the realities."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4ef0f3b923f54ed7a7933c42c2d2d764_46",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The allegations in the complaint are required to be scrutinised with great care and circumspection\"."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fc1439eeb27a4d03b8fc4c685a79fc6b_47",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the case in hand, no material is produced on record to indicate that the applicant was involved in the present crime of selling the said contraband articles in Maharashtra."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "47c9cae134654b78a06b50a929a4df19_48",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nAs undisputedly, the contraband was seized within the territorial jurisdiction of Maharashtra from accused Nos. 1 and 2 and not from the possession of the applicant."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "986062457d6d4cf89e2862c054f6c056_50",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In view of the aforesaid discussion, we find that continuation of the proceedings against the applicant would result in abuse of process of the Court and would not serve the ends of justice."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "00f3ac60c6d1493abedbb34bb8f659af_51",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS",
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
